147
00:10:23,989 --> 00:10:28,549
Am I to comprend that you have devoured all the sweets in the factory, my little bon vivant?

148
00:10:29,729 --> 00:10:31,109
Did you get that?

149
00:10:31,169 --> 00:10:34,629
Yep, that was me. I could go for some more right about now.

150
00:10:35,649 --> 00:10:38,169
Unfortunately, the candies have met their denouement.

151
00:10:38,169 --> 00:10:40,169
