152
00:10:42,049 --> 00:10:49,409
Attends, that is the jolly roger of our boss, Charlotte Lin-Lin, also known as Big Mom of the Four Emperors.

153
00:10:49,869 --> 00:10:54,669
That symbol indicates that this island is Mama's territory, d'accord?

154
00:10:55,469 --> 00:11:01,289
You see, Mama owns the place, which means Fishman Island is under Big Mom's protection.

155
00:11:01,929 --> 00:11:06,929
That's a nice thing to do. I like your boss already. Kind of weird name, though.

156
00:11:06,929 --> 00:11:11,209
Au contraire, mon ami. This is a business deal.

157
00:11:11,949 --> 00:11:12,149
Huh?

158
00:11:12,669 --> 00:11:19,769
We allow them the protection of our mark, and in exchange, they have to pay Mama ten tons of sweets every month.

159
00:11:20,289 --> 00:11:21,309
That's a lot.

160
00:11:21,609 --> 00:11:26,869
Oui, monsieur. There is nothing in this world Mama loves more than sweets.

161
00:11:27,909 --> 00:11:31,409
Mama says sweets from Fishman Island are like creme de la creme, you know.

162
00:11:32,689 --> 00:11:35,869
Pay up tomorrow, and we will bid you adieu.

163
00:11:35,869 --> 00:11:41,669
I'm sorry, sir, but I told you before, the machinery used to make the candy was badly damaged.

164
00:11:42,069 --> 00:11:46,549
It'll take us at least two weeks to make the repairs. We won't be ready tomorrow.

165
00:11:46,809 --> 00:11:48,749
