166
00:11:48,969 --> 00:11:51,729
Hey, fancy! Why can't you just wait a while?

167
00:11:52,309 --> 00:11:57,769
Yeah, why doesn't your boss have the balls to come talk to us himself? He's one of the Four Emperors, isn't he?

168
00:11:57,769 --> 00:12:02,949
Where are your manners? Our leader happens to be a madame pirate and a fearsome one at that.

169
